This chapter shares only Opening.

Use the page library.
Use the foundation, lettering and portraits chapters.

To stroke from a left (number) by a top (number) to a right (number) at a bottom (number) with a shade (number) over a breadth (number):
  Let the offset be 0 - 1.
  If the breadth is 4:
    Set the offset to 0 - 2.
  If the breadth is 7:
    Set the offset to 0 - 3.
  Repeat the breadth times:
    Trace Screen from (the left + the offset) by the top to (the right + the offset) at the bottom with the shade.
    Trace Screen from the left by (the top + the offset) to the right at (the bottom + the offset) with the shade.
    Add 1 to the offset.

